Hi Robert Samuel,

I would like to schedule a time to talk with you regarding this dismissal a=
nd hear from you about your experience and the expectations as they were sh=
ared with you. I do also need to gather information from the park as well, =
so a phone call tomorrow would be best.

Are you available for tomorrow at 9:00 am or 1:00 pm? And is this the best =
number to reach you at: 458-230-1869?

